{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is found, move to it, take it, and move it to destination. Check and perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectTemperature    />\"",
